{"id": "68847", "title": "惹火萝莉夜夜欢", "author": "二姑娘", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 6, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68847.htm", "intro": "花季般的女孩，本应该过着快乐无忧的生活，没有想到一次偶遇，却成为某高官的情人，靠着男人的势力，游走在灯红酒绿的夜场，让自己陷入了一次次的危险与阴谋中。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68847", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10548886.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10548887.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10548888.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10548889.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10548890.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-50完结", "file": "10548891.html", "available": true}]}